    :func:`torch.div` with ``rounding_mode='trunc'``.

Computes :attr:`input` divided by :attr:`other`, elementwise, and floors
the result.

.. math::
    \text{{out}}_i = \text{floor} \left( \frac{{\text{{input}}_i}}{{\text{{other}}_i}} \right)



